
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>受注画面</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/orders.css">
</head>

<body>
  <header>
    <h1>受注画面</h1>
  </header>

  <main>
    <nav>
      <a href="/mobile">モバイル画面</a>
      <a href="/">GPSマップ</a>
      <a href="/orders">発注一覧</a>
      <a href="/orders/new">新規発注</a>
    </nav>

    <div class="card">
      <p>届いた発注リクエストを確認し、提供可能な物資の数量を回答できます。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="orders-table-scroll">
      <table class="responsive-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Order ID</th>
            <th>発注ノード</th>
            <th>対象領域</th>
            <th>必要数合計</th>
            <th>受け数合計</th>
            <th>残数合計</th>
            <th>作成日時</th>
            <th>Reply</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>

        <tbody>
          <% orders.forEach(o => { %>
            <tr>
              <td data-label="Order ID"><%= o.order_id %></td>
              <td data-label="発注ノード"><%= o.requester_node %></td>
              <td data-label="対象領域"><%= o.target_area %></td>
              <td data-label="必要数合計"><%= o.total_requested || 0 %></td>
              <td data-label="受け数合計"><%= o.total_accepted || 0 %></td>
              <td data-label="残数合計"><%= o.total_remaining || 0 %></td>
              <td data-label="作成日時"><%= o.created_at %></td>
              <td data-label="Reply">
                <a href="/requests/<%= o.order_id %>/reply">提供可能数を返す</a>
              </td>
            </tr>
          <% }) %>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
